                  "fill": "$hz-text-2",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Every prompt you send to ChatGPT, Claude or a similar assistant from a work device is checked on its way out. Most go straight through untouched. When something sensitive is in it, Hajiz swaps it for a placeholder, removes it, asks a person to look, or stops the prompt, and tells you which.",
